  <div><p class="eyebrow">What the work can include</p><h2>A clear experience and a practical handover.</h2></div>
  <ul class="service-checklist"><li>Content and user-journey planning</li><li>Responsive information design</li><li>Interaction and animation prototypes</li><li>Accessible front-end production</li><li>Microsites and dissemination resources</li><li>Documentation and maintainable delivery</li></ul>
</section>

