<section class="section-shell service-questions" aria-labelledby="service-questions-heading">
  <p class="eyebrow">Working with us</p>
  <h2 id="service-questions-heading">Practical questions</h2>
  <dl>
    <dt>When is an interactive resource more useful than a static document?</dt>
    <dd>Interaction is useful when readers need to explore different views, compare information or choose the level of detail relevant to them. We select the format around the content and user need.</dd>
    <dt>Can you turn research or programme findings into a digital resource?</dt>
    <dd>Yes. We create research microsites, interactive explainers, animated explanations and digital documents that help share completed research and programme outputs with wider audiences.</dd>
  </dl>
